<title>JAPAN: Reuters average September Tapis assessed at $22.73.</title>
<headline>Reuters average September Tapis assessed at $22.73.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average Reuters price for Malaysian Tapis for September was $22.73.</p>
<p>Malaysia's Petronas uses Reuters morning quotes in its monthly term crude formula. Reuters prices:</p>
<p>   September  2  $21.55    3  $21.65    4  $21.85</p>
<p>		  5  $21.75    6  $22.05    9  $22.15</p>
<p>		 10  $22.20   11  $22.20   12  $22.35</p>
<p>		 13  $22.60   16  $23.35   17  $22.95</p>
<p>		 18  $22.65   19  $22.85   20  $23.18</p>
<p>		 23  $23.05   24  $23.20   25  $23.43</p>
<p>		 26  $24.15   27  $24.20   30  $23.95</p>
</text>
